# SHA-256 of kronos-base.onnx (NeoQuasar/Kronos-base, HF revision: main)
#
# This file is the pinned checksum gate. `crates/forecast/build.rs` asserts
# that the on-disk SHA-256 of `crates/forecast/assets/kronos-base.onnx`
# matches this value at build time.
#
# How to update:
#   1. Run `scripts/dev/kronos_torch_to_onnx.py` to (re-)export the ONNX.
#   2. Run `sha256sum crates/forecast/assets/kronos-base.onnx` (Linux) or
#      `shasum -a 256 crates/forecast/assets/kronos-base.onnx` (macOS).
#   3. Replace the hash below with the new value.
#   4. Git LFS add + commit the new ONNX file.
#
# License: NeoQuasar/Kronos weights are MIT-licensed.
# See: https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos
#
# Status: PENDING — kronos-base.onnx not yet committed (git LFS bootstrap
# required; see crates/forecast/README.md § LFS bootstrap).
# The build.rs checksum gate is disabled when the ONNX file is absent.
PENDING
